@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #41546B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam classBorderColor #59708C
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF3F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #59708C
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
hide footbox
title RBAC1 设置角色继承 · ddd
participant "obj: DomainRbacAdminController" as C
participant "service: DddDomainRbacService" as S
participant "repository: RbacRepositoryPort" as P
participant "cache: CacheGateway" as Cache
participant "events: DomainEventPublisher" as W
autonumber
activate C
C -> S: roleParents(role, dept, app, parentIds, actor)
activate S
S -> P: lockIds = domainRoleIds(dept, app) ∪ {role} ∪ parentIds（写事务外）
activate P
deactivate P
group 写事务（TransactionRunner）
 S -> P: domainRoleIds = lockDomainRolesByIds(dept, app, lockIds)
 activate P
 deactivate P
 note right of S: 首条 SQL 仅按 PRIMARY(id) 升序加排他锁，不提前开启 ReadView
 S -> P: edges = domainRoleInheritanceEdges(dept, app)
 activate P
 deactivate P
 alt 自身、跨域或循环继承
  S --> C: DomainException -> ApiException (403/409)
 else 合法
  S -> P: replaceRoleParents(role, dept, app, existing, parentIds)
  activate P
  deactivate P
  S -> Cache: touchDomain(dept, app)
  activate Cache
  deactivate Cache
  S -> W: emit(role.inheritance.changed)
  activate W
  deactivate W
  S --> C: 200 OkVO
 end
end
deactivate S
deactivate C
legend bottom
DddDomainRbacService 在写事务内首条 SQL 仅按聚簇主键升序加锁，随后无锁读边在持锁后建立 ReadView，
并按精确联合主键差集删旧插新，彻底消除同域成环、跨索引死锁与跨域共享锁死锁。
endlegend
@enduml
